{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"optional"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"didUpdateState"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"event"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@GenesysCloudCore@objc(cs)ChatStateEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChatStateEvent","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.genesys.cloud.ui\/documentation\/GenesysCloud\/ChatStateEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChatStateEvent"},{"text":" instance representing the current state of the chat.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChatState"},{"text":" enumeration defines the possible states of the chat lifecycle.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"event"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This delegate is triggered when there is a change in the chat state. The host application can monitor and respond to state changes, such as when a chat starts, disconnects, or ends."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Chat States","level":2,"anchor":"Chat-States","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The chat can be in one of the following states, represented by the "},{"code":"ChatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" enum (raw values in parentheses):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"chatCreated (1)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The chat session has been created but not started.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatStarted (2)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat session has started."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatPreparing (3)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat is preparing socket connection."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatPrepared (4)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat has been prepared, configuration fetched and is ready."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatDisconnected (5)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat has been disconnected in case of an error."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"chatReconnecting (6)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat is attempting to reconnect."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatReconnected (7)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat has successfully reconnected."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"chatEnding (8)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat is in the process of ending."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"chatEnded (9)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat session has ended."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chatClosed (10)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat has closed."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unavailable (18)"},{"type":"text","text":": The chat is unavailable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Usage","level":2,"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement this method in the delegate to respond to changes in the chat’s lifecycle.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Common use cases include updating the UI, logging chat state transitions, or performing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actions based on specific states."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Swift","level":3,"anchor":"Swift","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["func didUpdateState(_ event: ChatStateEvent) {","    switch event.state {","    case .chatStarted:","        \/\/ handle chat started","    case .chatEnded:","        \/\/ handle chat ended","    default:","        \/\/ handle other states","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.genesys.cloud.ui\/documentation\/GenesysCloud","doc:\/\/com.genesys.cloud.ui\/documentation\/GenesysCloud\/ChatControllerDelegate"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.genesys.cloud.ui\/documentation\/GenesysCloud\/ChatControllerDelegate\/didUpdateState(_:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Notifies the delegate of a change in the chat’s state."}],"metadata":{"title":"didUpdateState(_:)","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GenesysCloud"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"didUpdateState","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@GenesysCloudCore@objc(cs)ChatStateEvent","text":"ChatStateEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"c:@M@GenesysCloud@objc(pl)ChatControllerDelegate(im)didUpdateState:"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/genesyscloud\/chatcontrollerdelegate\/didupdatestate(_:)"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.genesys.cloud.ui/documentation/GenesysCloud":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"GenesysCloud","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"genesys-logo.svg"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a native, fully featured mobile messenger solution to your iOS app, powered by Genesys Cloud."}],"identifier